{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9c3f567c4180abcae8f9e8eab35709405242ddcca42c733a869588f16cde85b8", "ja": "（今日のPVは、迫力ある殺陣が見せ場！　撮影は順調\nだけど、奈緒は何かが引っ掛かっているようで……）", "zh": "（今天的PV看点是气势十足的杀阵！拍摄进行得很顺利，但奈绪似乎有些在意什么……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "419858b31f81d09b09a64ddde7986bfbd340188d6676b78cf8a092e7e2c1d131", "ja": "うーん……イマイチやなぁ。\nもっと、なんかできるような……？", "zh": "嗯……总觉得差点意思啊。\n是不是还能再做点什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4b50dbbff3e183a5f61a9d2b18c553329e0d00dd55b9578b28634458700f6246", "ja": "お疲れ様。今のでイマイチなのか？\n結構、カッコよかったと思うけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了。刚才那样还不够好吗？\n我觉得已经挺帅的了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "d5edc39f742a4dd6894557e9151b9827a3f7932b1f796aa40c89263688baf26b", "ja": "うーん、普通にカッコよくできたとは思うんですけど。\nなんやろ……何か、ひと味足りひん気して。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得确实做得挺帅的。不过怎么说呢……总觉得还差那么点味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "fe46e1d9da0b2aa458aee0d2555f0a5f705275464e0eb2e64680f4bfca24d8c1", "ja": "でも何が足りひんのかがわからないんですっ！\nさっきから、ず～っと悩んでて。", "zh": "可是，我就是不知道到底缺了什么嘛！\n从刚才开始，我一直苦恼到现在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_1005_p", "source_sha256": "933e3746895ae333405b86ffe710663af83031513b04e478008bf934ed0420ef", "ja": "ふむ……じゃあ、一緒に考えてみようか。\nふたりで考えれば、何かアイディアが出るかも。", "zh": "嗯……那我们一起想想吧。\n两个人一起思考的话，说不定能想到什么主意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "100742ef5309cee851f58794470f7adce02dc5123f1d0b9f58ddba4759033a47", "ja": "ほんまですか！？　それなら……殺陣の相手役、\nやってもらっていいですか？　何か閃くかもしれんし。", "zh": "真的吗！？　那样的话……能请你来当一下杀阵的对手吗？说不定能让我想到什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c533d450d54f542b2516be8df53a2dbc863c1ece20b75b548ca0141b1f593fba", "ja": "敵役をやればいいんだな？　わかった。\nそれじゃあ、いくぞ……。", "zh": "演反派就可以了吧？明白了。\n那就开始吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_1008", "source_sha256": "8845806dc260744bbf099063046d35493a291c1113dc861b2abf2f0c2010e374", "ja": "ウォーッ！", "zh": "呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2000_p", "source_sha256": "8ecf0dec594af16a3edbf9b370b15fb92321297fd1070a4bfd5fbd4ba89a2430", "ja": "ウオオオォォォォーッ！", "zh": "呜喔喔喔喔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "a66cefbd74f7fc5801995060290ea2ddcfc224df945f9c85623130214ba6ab91", "ja": "よっしゃ！　ここで私が掴んで、\n投げ飛ばして……あ、あれ？　……わわっ！？", "zh": "好嘞！看我在这里抓住，\n然后摔出去……咦、奇怪？……哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2002_se", "source_sha256": "5e8e2eab075c5210414e51537a05e3eaf921872b27db7647dfb2f07d67790a5d", "ja": "ドサッ", "zh": "咚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2003_p", "source_sha256": "fbc7b05dc79438077e971c5e44f9f6c3f8d7462e31e9cdd12599156388fbef69", "ja": "奈緒！？　大丈夫か？\nゴメン、ちょっと勢いがつき過ぎちゃって……。", "zh": "奈绪！？没事吧？\n抱歉，刚才有点冲得太猛了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2004_037nao", "source_sha256": "017739f33081bf9cc666bf5d8b237415edbe79b2b3303c18e666956a46dd6999", "ja": "あははっ！　これぐらい大丈夫ですよ。\n私、こう見えてタフなんで、気にせんといてください。", "zh": "啊哈哈！这点小事没关系啦。\n我别看这样，其实很抗造，所以不用在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2005_037nao", "source_sha256": "da09b748945242f1c2ce8ac605f156394ac96a18219fd0e3371111ddbea93ef1", "ja": "せやけど、{$P$}さん、迫力\nあるなぁ♪　これやと私、ピンチになってまう……。", "zh": "不过，{$P$}先生，气势真强啊♪　这样下去我可就要陷入危机了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2006_037nao", "source_sha256": "0ba727b33b7957f79729f65b59bb14498d3206b14e643108876929071c5a152d", "ja": "ん？　ピンチ……あ、あーっ！\nわかりました！　ピンチですよ、ピンチ！", "zh": "嗯？危机……啊、啊——！\n我想到了！就是危机啊，危机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2007_p", "source_sha256": "8c14703cd71e9d9e798a7f45f70038c56ab94c26330b3a122603bcdbc90d90dd", "ja": "うん？　どういう意味だ？", "zh": "嗯？这是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2008_037nao", "source_sha256": "4b97b55831d1607c546b6c421f94d299e52ea76af8e3ba939b682a7986340223", "ja": "私って、かなり強い設定ですけど……もっと\n追い詰められた方が、ドキドキすると思うんですよ。", "zh": "我这个设定已经相当强了，不过……我觉得要是再把我逼到绝境一点，应该会更刺激吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2009_037nao", "source_sha256": "1eae57ac45bafa1939a623e3a9669bc9370db09d4c571223a09ec7f13c78fcb0", "ja": "なんやろ……メリハリをつける、みたいな！\nその方が、バシッとカッコよう見えると思いません？", "zh": "怎么说呢……就像是要有张有弛！  \n那样看起来会更帅气利落，不觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2010_p", "source_sha256": "dcd60e138a217440e9756d40de3ae8eb85c38b27f9738de84d3975be11333d5e", "ja": "なるほど、ピンチのシーンを入れるって事か。\n確かに、その方が面白いかもな。", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说要加入陷入危机的场面啊。\n确实，那样可能会更有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2011_037nao", "source_sha256": "4ba578bb49fa995d105ab9aa2524b1944ed198accfa0002b29e4b0869f0738be", "ja": "でしょ～？　いや～、{$P$}さんに\n相談して正解やったわ！　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "对吧～？哎呀～，能找{$P$}先生商量真是太好了！谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2012_037nao", "source_sha256": "b247507a9be683b3d36973df302295b0cb98e3a57d8c65836f051eb017d1c630", "ja": "ほな、ちょっと監督さんに相談してきます！\nバシッとキメてきますから、見ててくださいね！", "zh": "那我去找导演商量一下！  \n我会干脆利落地搞定的，请看着吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2013_null", "source_sha256": "42acc9a8ef63bfd6df3fc2445583dff7865dfc3e2400fe4fdb1d520376896b22", "ja": "PV撮影中……", "zh": "PV拍摄中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2014_037nao", "source_sha256": "a80071e3fb190a1b8e6dd37005e13a251a5e32bd4aeea864ea532c7296b38ae9", "ja": "くっ……アカン！　このままじゃ、負ける……。\nこうなったら……キザミ、あれをやるで！", "zh": "唔……不行！这样下去会输的……\n既然如此……刻，施展那个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2015_037nao", "source_sha256": "7764823105d18390dfe8b68a3859311cf5bf7c6fb4f6887b32e83ceb483a16d1", "ja": "全霊力を、私に集めるんや！　はあぁぁ……！\nこれが、キツネ一族に伝わる秘剣……！", "zh": "把全部的力量，都集中到我身上！哈啊啊啊……！\n这就是狐狸一族代代相传的秘剑……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2016_037nao", "source_sha256": "08a01b2fbb0e56214a342d3e01cb3d996021bed4f57db580ee3e8e6e2ee78565", "ja": "受けてみい、必殺・紅衝牙ーっ！", "zh": "接招吧，必杀·红冲牙——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0254_2017_p", "source_sha256": "537efeb49638286157bb9e1479978e24fef1ddb8341aed7eceeb087636d16aa8", "ja": "（よし、キマッた！　奈緒の必殺技！\nうーん、手に汗握るPVに仕上がったな……！）", "zh": "（好，完美！奈绪的必杀技！\n嗯，拍成了让人捏一把汗的PV……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
